title: "PIANO_H7 — Controller board firmware for an optical digital MIDI piano"
abstract: >-
  Firmware for the master controller board (STM32H723) of a self-built
  digital MIDI piano with optical key sensing. Provides an LVGL touch UI,
  a class-compliant USB-MIDI interface, a multidrop UART master bus to the
  PIANO_G4_cbt6 sensor boards, hammer-flight-time-to-velocity modelling,
  calibration storage and a custom bootloader.
